527 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 321 0 R
/T (This block monitors the counter value \(TCNT\) to detect overflow and underflow events: - Count-up mode \(count_up_down = 0\): When TCNT reaches 8'hFF+1, the TMR_OVF flag is set high for one clock cycle to indicate an overflow. - Count-down mode \(count_up_down = 1\): When TCNT reaches 8'h00+1, the TMR_UDF flag is set high for one clock cycle to indicate an underflow.)
/E (This block monitors the counter value \(TCNT\) to detect overflow and underflow events: - Count-up mode \(count_up_down = 0\): When TCNT reaches 8'hFF+1, the TMR_OVF flag is set high for one clock cycle to indicate an overflow. - Count-down mode \(count_up_down = 1\): When TCNT reaches 8'h00+1, the TMR_UDF flag is set high for one clock cycle to indicate an underflow.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
