1897 0 obj
<<
/Title (This block monitors the counter value \(TCNT\) to detect overflow and underflow events: - Count-up mode \(count_up_down = 0\): When TCNT reaches 8'hFF+1, the TMR_OVF flag is set high for one clock cycle to indicate an overflow. - Count-down mode \(count_up_down = 1\): When TCNT reaches 8'h00+1, the TMR_UDF flag is set high for one clock cycle to indicate an underflow.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1893 0 R
>>
endobj
